# Multi-Vehicle Mission Management

## Vehicle Mission Distribution

### Mission Types
- **NON ID 1 Vehicles**: Sequential waypoint missions with altitude separation
- **Drone ID 1**: Special observation/loiter mission at safe position

### Altitude Separation Strategy
```cpp
// 10m altitude difference per drone to avoid collisions
int vehicleAltitude = altitude + (i * 10);
```

### Mission Indexing
- **Takeoff**: Always index 1 for each vehicle
- **Waypoints**: Sequential indices 2, 3, 4, 5... within each vehicle
- **Land**: Final index for each vehicle

## Vehicle Switching in QML
```qml
// Store current active vehicle
var currentVehicle = QGroundControl.multiVehicleManager.activeVehicle;

// Switch to target vehicle if different
if (targetVehicle && targetVehicle !== currentVehicle) {
    QGroundControl.multiVehicleManager.activeVehicle = targetVehicle;
}

// Perform operation
// ... add mission items ...

// Switch back to original vehicle
if (targetVehicle && targetVehicle !== currentVehicle) {
    QGroundControl.multiVehicleManager.activeVehicle = currentVehicle;
}
```

## Mission Clearing Strategy
- **Global Clear**: Clear all vehicles at mission generation start
- **No Individual Clearing**: Avoid clearing individual vehicles during generation
- **Sequential Processing**: Process vehicles one at a time

## Coordinate Management
```cpp
// Set altitude for all waypoints
for (QGeoCoordinate& coord : vehicleWaypoints) {
    coord.setAltitude(vehicleAltitude);
}

// Validate coordinates
if (!coordinate.isValid()) {
    qCWarning(MissionServiceLog) << "Invalid coordinate provided";
    return;
}
```

## Signal Emission Patterns
```cpp
// Emit signals with target vehicle
emit addTakeoffItemRequested(takeoffCoord, vehicleAltitude, vehicle);
emit addWaypointItemRequested(waypoint, vehicleAltitude, vehicle);
emit addLandItemRequested(landCoord, vehicle);
```

## Error Handling
- Check vehicle availability before operations
- Validate mission manager exists
- Handle altitude limits and safety margins
- Provide meaningful error messages

